# CODEOWNERS — assigns every path to the repository operator
#
# Purpose (spec framework-runtime-neutral-v3 §9 "Required default-branch
# rules"): combined with the default-branch ruleset
# (templates/default-branch-ruleset.json) and its "require review from Code
# Owners" rule, this file ensures only the operator's own approval satisfies
# a pull request's approval requirement. An approval from any agent identity
# (the OpenClaw builder identity, a Claude session, or any other non-operator
# account) never counts, no matter who authored the PR.
#
# This file MUST live on the repository's default branch — GitHub only
# honours CODEOWNERS from the default branch's HEAD, not from a feature
# branch or PR.
#
# Replace {{OPERATOR_GITHUB_HANDLE}} below with the operator's GitHub
# username before installing. Example: @michaelhazza
#
# See docs/openclaw-pilot-adoption.md for the full installation walkthrough.

* @{{OPERATOR_GITHUB_HANDLE}}
